# Secure Runtime Alpha 3881-3940/4021-4100 -- Electron build/package spike
# output. Lives entirely inside packages/fedos-desktop-electron-spike/ (its
# own, physically isolated package -- see Alpha 4021-4100's own docs for
# why). `node_modules/`/`dist/` above already match there too (unanchored
# patterns); `dist-package/` is this package's own packaging output
# directory, named distinctly from `dist/` (its plain TypeScript build
# output) to keep the two build steps' own output clearly separate. Never
# tracked, never placed under p2p/.tmp_gen. Regenerated on demand; never a
# required, committed configuration-only artifact.
/packages/fedos-desktop-electron-spike/dist-package/

